#: kmreaderwin.cpp:885
msgid ""
"Operations on the parent of a closed thread are now performed on all "
"messages of that thread. That means it is now possible for example to delete "
"a whole thread or subthread by closing it and deleting the parent."
msgstr ""
"Operacije na roditelju zatvorenog threada se sada obavljaju na svim "
"porukama tog threada. To znači da je sada moguće, na primjer, obrisati "
"čitav thread ili podthread zatvarajući ga i brišući početnu poruku."

