#: rc.cpp:40 rc.cpp:41
msgid "Certificate Wizard"
msgstr "Čarobnjak za certifikate"

#: rc.cpp:42
msgid ""
"<b>Welcome to the Certificate Wizard!</b>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"In a few easy steps, this wizard will help you with the creation of a "
"certificate. You use your certificates in order to sign messages, to encrypt "
"messages and to decrypt messages that other people send to you in encrypted "
"form.\n"
"<p>\n"
"The certificates can either be generated in a centralized or a decentralized "
"manner. Please contact your local help desk if you are unsure how to create "
"a certificate in your organization."
msgstr ""
"<b>Dobro došli u Čarobnjak za certifikate!</b>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"U par jednostavnih koraka, ovaj čarobnjak će vam pomoći da "
"napravite certifikat. Možete koristiti vaše certifikate za potpisivanje "
"poruka, šifrovanje poruka ili dešifrovanje poruka koje su vam drugi "
"ljudi poslali u šifrovanom obliku.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Certifikati mogu biti generisani ili u centralizovanom ili u decentralizovanom "
"stilu. Molim kontaktirajte vašu lokalnu tehničku podršku ako niste sigurni "
"kako se prave certifikati u vašoj organizaciji."

#: rc.cpp:43
msgid "Your Personal Data"
msgstr "Vaši lični podaci"

#: rc.cpp:44
msgid ""
"On this page, you will enter some personal data that will be stored in your "
"certificate and that will help other people to determine that it is actually "
"you who is sending a message."
msgstr ""
"Na ovoj stranici trebate unijeti neke lične podatke koji će biti "
"smješteni u vašem certifikatu, koji će pomoći drugim ljudima da odrede "
"da ste vi ustvari onaj ko šalje poruku."

#: rc.cpp:45
msgid "Enter your name here"
msgstr "Unesite vaše ime ovdje"

#: rc.cpp:46
msgid "Enter your name here as it should be shown in the certificate."
msgstr "Ovdje unesite vaše ime onako kako ono treba biti u certifikatu."

#: rc.cpp:47
msgid "Enter your organization here"
msgstr "Unesite vašu organizaciju ovdje"

#: rc.cpp:48
msgid ""
"Enter your organization (e.g. your company, your department, or your "
"authority) here as it should appear on the certificate."
msgstr ""
"Unesite ovdje vašu organizaciju (npr. vašu kompaniju, odjel ili nadležnost) "
"onako kako želite da se pojavljuje na certifikatu."

#: rc.cpp:49
msgid "Enter your email address here"
msgstr "Unesite e-mail adresu ovdje"

#: rc.cpp:50
msgid ""
"Enter the email address here which you want to use in connection with the "
"certificate."
msgstr "Unesite e-mail adresu koju želite koristiti u vezi sa certifikatom."

#: rc.cpp:52
msgid "&Department:"
msgstr "O&djel:"

#: rc.cpp:54
msgid "&Organization:"
msgstr "&Organizacija:"

#: rc.cpp:55
msgid "Certificate Generation"
msgstr "Generisanje certifikata"

#: rc.cpp:56
msgid ""
"On this page, you will select whether certificate generation is done "
"centralized or decentralized. Please check with your local help desk if you "
"are unsure what to select here."
msgstr ""
"Na ovoj stranici ćete izabrati da li se generisanje certifikata vrši centralizovano "
"ili decentralizovano. Molim provjerite sa vašom lokalnom tehničkom "
"podrškom ako niste sigurni šta izabrati ovdje."

#: rc.cpp:57
msgid "Certificate &Generation"
msgstr "&Generisanje certifikata"

#: rc.cpp:58
msgid "&Centralized generation"
msgstr "&Centralizovano generisanje"

#: rc.cpp:59
msgid "&Decentralized generation"
msgstr "&Decentralizovano generisanje"

#: rc.cpp:60
msgid "&Email address of the CA that issues certificates:"
msgstr "&E-mail adresa CA koji izdaje certifikate:"

#: rc.cpp:61
msgid "Your Certificate is Ready to Be Sent"
msgstr "Vaš certifikat je spreman za slanje"

#: rc.cpp:62
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"Your signature key pair is now ready to be sent to the CA (certification "
"authority) which will generate a certificate for you and send it back via "
"email. Please review the certificate shown below. You should also write down "
"the checksum so that you can match it against the certificate sent back by "
"the CA.\n"
"<p>\n"
"If you want to change anything, press Back and make your changes. Otherwise "
"press Finish to send the signature key pair to the CA.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"Vaš par ključeva za potpis je sada poslat CA (certifikacijkom autoritetu) "
"koji će generisati certifikat za vas i poslati vam ga putem e-maila. "
"Molim provjerite certifikat koji je prikazan ispod. Takođe trebate zapisati "
"checksum tako da je možete uporediti sa certifikatom kojeg vam "
"pošalje CA.\n"
"<p>n "
"Ako želite promijeniti nešto, kliknite Nazad i napravite izmjene. U suprotnom, "
"kliknite na Završi da pošaljete par ključeva CA.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:63
msgid "Directory Services Configuration"
msgstr "Podešavanje imeničkog servisa"

#: rc.cpp:64
msgid "X.&500 Directory services:"
msgstr "X.&500 imenički servis:"

#: rc.cpp:65
msgid "Server Name"
msgstr "Naziv servera"

#: rc.cpp:66
msgid "Port"
msgstr "Port"

#: rc.cpp:68
msgid "Select Directory Services to Use Here"
msgstr "Ovdje izaberite imenički servis koji želite koristiti"

#: rc.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>X.500 Directory Services</h1>\n"
"You can use X.500 directory services to retrieve certificates and "
"certificate revocation lists that are not saved locally. Ask your local "
"administrator if you want to make use of this feature and are unsure which "
"directory service you can use.\n"
"<p>\n"
"If you do not use a directory service, you can still use local "
"certificates.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>X.500 imenički servis</h1>\n"
"Možete koristiti X.500 servis imenika da dobavite certifikate i liste za "
"opoziv certifikata koje nisu snimljene lokalno. Pitajte vašeg lokalnog "
"administratora da li želite koristiti ovu mogućnost ako niste sigurni koji "
"imenički servis možete koristiti.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Ako ne koristite imenički servis, još uvijek možete koristiti lokalne "
"certifikate.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:70
msgid "Local/Remote Certificates"
msgstr "Lokalni/udaljeni certifikati"

#: rc.cpp:71 rc.cpp:81
msgid "&First local, then directory services"
msgstr "&Prvo lokalni, zatim imenički servisi"

#: rc.cpp:72
msgid "Click to use both local and remote certificates"
msgstr "Kliknite da koristite i lokalne i udaljene certifikate"

#: rc.cpp:73
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>First Local, Then Directory Services</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will first try to find the "
"necessary certificates on your local computer. If they cannot be found "
"there, it will query the directory services specified in the list above in "
"the order given there.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Prvo lokalni, zatim imenički servisi</h1>\n"
"Kada je izabrana ova opcija, e-mail klijent će prvo pokušati pronaći "
"potrebne certifikate na vašem lokalnom računaru. Ako ih ne može "
"pronaći, onda će poslati upit imeničkom servisu koji je naveden na "
"listi iznad i to redom navedenim tamo.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:74 rc.cpp:84
msgid "&Local only, don't use directory services"
msgstr "Samo &lokalni, ne koristi imeničke servise"

#: rc.cpp:75
msgid "Click to use only local certificates"
msgstr "Kliknite da koristite samo lokalne certifikate"

#: rc.cpp:76
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Local Only, Don't Use Directory Services</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will only try to find the "
"necessary certificates on your local computer. If they cannot be found "
"there, they are not available for the operation in question.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Samo lokalni, ne koristi imeničke servise</h1>\n"
"Kada je izabrana ova opcija, e-mail klijent će samo pokušati pronaći "
"potrebne certifikate na vašem lokalnom računaru. Ako ih ne može "
"pronaći, oni neće biti dostupni za potrebnu operaciju.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:77 rc.cpp:87
msgid "&Directory services only, don't use locally saved information"
msgstr "Samo &imenički servisi, ne koristi lokalno spremljene informacije"

#: rc.cpp:78
msgid "Click to use remote certificates only"
msgstr "Kliknite da koristite samo udaljene certifikate"

#: rc.cpp:79
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Directory Services Only</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will not use the certificates "
"on your local computer. Instead, it will query the directory services "
"specified in the list above in the order given there. If none of the "
"services has the certificate in question, it cannot be used for the "
"operation.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Samo imenički servisi</h1>\n"
"Kada je izabrana ova opcija, e-mail klijent neće koristiti certifikate "
"na vašem lokalnom računaru. Umjesto toga, poslaće upit imeničkim "
"servisima koji su navedeni na listi iznad, tim redom. Ako nijedan "
"servis nema potrebni certifikat, ne možete ga koristiti za potrebnu "
"operaciju.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:80
msgid "Local/Remote CRLs"
msgstr "Lokalni/udaljeni CRL"

#: rc.cpp:82
msgid "Click to use both local and remote CRLs"
msgstr "Kliknite da koristite i lokalne i udaljene CRLove"

#: rc.cpp:83
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>First Local, Then Directory Services</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will first try to find the "
"necessary certificate revocation lists (CRLs) on your local computer. If "
"they cannot be found there, it will query the directory services specified "
"in the list above in the order given there.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:85
msgid "Click to use only local CRLs"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:86
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Local Only, Don't Use Directory Services</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will only try to find the "
"necessary certificate revocation lists (CRLs) on your local computer. If "
"they cannot be found there, they are not available for the operation in "
"question.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:88
msgid "Click to use remote CRLs only"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:89
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Directory Services Only</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will not use the certificate "
"revocation lists (CRLs) on your local computer. Instead, it will query the "
"directory services specified in the list above in the order given there. If "
"none of the services has the certificate in question, it cannot be used for "
"the operation.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:90
msgid "&Add Service..."
msgstr "&Dodaj servis..."

#: rc.cpp:91
msgid "Click to add a service"
msgstr "Kliknite da dodate servis"

#: rc.cpp:92
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Add a Directory Service</h1>\n"
"By clicking this button, you can select a new directory service to be used "
"for retrieving certificates and CRLs. You will be asked for the server name "
"and an optional description.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""

